      <div class="video-list">
        <h2 class="section-title"><i class="material-icons">person</i> About Ustaz Qarni Edrus</h2>
        <p>Ustaz Qarni Edrus is a respected Islamic scholar who specializes in teaching daily sunnah practices and Quranic reflection. With over 15 years of experience in Islamic education, he has helped thousands of Muslims deepen their understanding of Islam through practical, everyday applications.</p>
        
        <h3 style="margin-top: 1.5rem; color: var(--primary-color);">Areas of Expertise</h3>
        <ul style="padding-left: 1.5rem; margin: 1rem 0;">
          <li>Daily Sunnah Practices</li>
          <li>Quranic Exegesis (Tafsir)</li>
          <li>Islamic Jurisprudence (Fiqh)</li>
          <li>Islamic Creed (Akidah)</li>
          <li>Prophet's Biography (Sirah)</li>
        </ul>
        
        <h3 style="margin-top: 1.5rem; color: var(--primary-color);">Teaching Methodology</h3>
        <p>Ustaz Qarni believes in making Islamic knowledge accessible to everyone. His approach combines classical scholarship with contemporary relevance, ensuring that learners can apply Islamic teachings in their daily lives. He emphasizes practical implementation of sunnah practices as a means to strengthen faith and character.</p>
        
        <h3 style="margin-top: 1.5rem; color: var(--primary-color);">Notable Contributions</h3>
        <ul style="padding-left: 1.5rem; margin: 1rem 0;">
          <li>"1000 Amalan Sunnah Sehari-Hari" Series</li>
          <li>Regular Quranic Tafsir Sessions</li>
          <li>Workshops on Practical Islam</li>
          <li>Youth Islamic Education Programs</li>
        </ul>
        
        <h3 style="margin-top: 1.5rem; color: var(--primary-color);">Extensive Playlist Collection</h3>
        <p>Ustaz Qarni has produced an extensive collection of educational content across multiple platforms, with over 16 playlists totaling more than 500 videos. His content covers a wide range of Islamic topics including:</p>
        <ul style="padding-left: 1.5rem; margin: 1rem 0;">
          <li>Aqidah and Islamic creed</li>
          <li>Hadith and Sunnah practices</li>
          <li>Quranic exegesis and reflection</li>
          <li>Prophetic biography and history</li>
          <li>Islamic jurisprudence and ethics</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
